  "limits": [
    "The tested Qt setting applies only to the application process. This does not test KWin render or commit scheduling.",
    "frameSwapped is a Qt signal. The read-only CRTC framebuffer observations cover the whole HDMI output and do not prove optical panel updates or client-specific presentations.",
    "The CRTC observer internally rejected zero and non-increasing DRM sequence values. This binary did not print the individual sequence values. Timing and framebuffer IDs remain available from each public WAIT_VBLANK observation.",
    "The controller checked zero DRM and display engine faults before and after all three arms. Individual arm fault counts were not acquired.",
    "The result applies to one fixed-size Qt scene on this exact kernel and display profile."
